    <string name="settings_registration_title">Phone registration</string>
    <string name="settings_registration_intro">The car only talks to phones it has registered, and it remembers at most 2. To register this phone (it must be on the car\'s Wi-Fi):</string>
    <string name="registration_steps">1. Sit in the car with the key and close the driver\'s door. Power switch OFF.\n2. Press the power switch once to ACC, without touching the brake (OFF → ACC).\n3. Within 10 seconds, press LOCK and UNLOCK on the key alternately — 10 presses in total, starting with LOCK.\n4. The car beeps: 1 beep = no phones registered, 2 = one phone, 3 = two phones (memory full — see below). It now waits up to 10 minutes.\n5. Tap Register.\n6. Switch the power OFF to finish. The car may restart its Wi-Fi; the app reconnects by itself.</string>
